1: # Press by Heart — Shopify Online Store 2.0 Theme
2: 
3: **Theme Name:** Press by heart  
4: **Version:** 1.0.0  
5: **Architecture:** Shopify Online Store 2.0 (OS 2.0)  
6: **Compatibility:** Shopify Admin, Theme Editor (Customizer), Liquid API, Ajax Cart API, Section Rendering API
7: 
8: ---
9: 
10: ## 💎 Overview
11: **Press by Heart** is a luxury, salon-quality press-on nail Shopify Online Store 2.0 theme. It provides a 100% pixel-perfect conversion of the approved design with zero hardcoding. All content, menus, banners, testimonials, product cards, collections, and policies are fully dynamic and manageable directly from the Shopify Theme Editor (Customizer).
12: 
13: ---
14: 
15: ## 📁 Theme Directory Structure
16: 
17: ```text
18: press-by-heart/
19: ├── assets/                     # Stylesheets, JS engines, local fonts, svg icons
20: │   ├── commerce.js             # Core OS 2.0 Ajax cart & variant state engine
21: │   ├── kids-menu.js            # Kids navigation and mobile menu logic
22: │   ├── style.css               # Base theme styles & typography
23: │   ├── refinements.css         # Visual styling, cart drawer & modal refinements
24: │   ├── product.css             # Product detail page layout & gallery styles
25: │   ├── shop-all.css            # Catalog grid, filter pill styles
26: │   ├── kids.css                # Kids collection layout & promo styling
27: │   └── shop-by-design.css      # Design chip interactive filter matrix
28: ├── config/
29: │   ├── settings_schema.json    # Global Theme Editor schema (colors, typography, cart)
30: │   └── settings_data.json      # Theme Editor default settings preset
31: ├── layout/
32: │   ├── theme.liquid            # Primary store wrapper (header, main, footer, drawer)
33: │   └── password.liquid         # Storefront password protection layout
34: ├── locales/
35: │   └── en.default.json         # Internationalization dictionary
36: ├── sections/                   # Modular Liquid sections with customizer schemas
37: │   ├── announcement-bar.liquid # Top alert bar with customizable text & link
38: │   ├── header.liquid           # Dynamic logo, navigation, mega menus, search & bag
39: │   ├── hero.liquid             # Hero banner with dynamic image, heading & CTA
40: │   ├── collections-grid.liquid # Elementor-style modular collection category cards
41: │   ├── benefits-bar.liquid     # Modular USP icons and value propositions
42: │   ├── best-sellers.liquid     # Dynamic product collection carousel/grid
43: │   ├── features-grid.liquid    # Modular highlight feature promo banners
44: │   ├── why-choose-us.liquid    # Modular testimonials & checklist with live preview
45: │   ├── instagram-grid.liquid   # Dynamic social media showcase grid
46: │   ├── footer.liquid           # Multi-column footer, newsletter, payment badges
47: │   ├── cart-drawer.liquid      # Dynamic slide-out cart drawer with promo code
48: │   ├── main-product.liquid     # PDP section with variant selector, gallery & tabs
49: │   ├── main-collection.liquid  # Collection catalog with filter chips & pagination
50: │   ├── main-kids.liquid        # Kids collection page with promo banner
51: │   ├── shop-by-design.liquid   # Shape, length, colour interactive design matrix
52: │   └── main-page.liquid        # Generic page content section
53: ├── snippets/                   # Reusable Liquid snippets
54: │   ├── product-card.liquid     # Dynamic product card with variant price & badges
55: │   ├── catalog-card.liquid     # Shop All & collection product card component
56: │   ├── mega-menu-shop-all.liquid     # Dynamic Shop All mega menu panel
57: │   ├── mega-menu-kids.liquid         # Dynamic Kids mega menu panel
58: │   ├── mega-menu-shop-by-design.liquid # Dynamic Shop by Design mega menu panel
59: │   ├── pagination.liquid       # Accessible page navigation snippet
60: │   └── theme-settings.liquid   # CSS custom properties injector